#==============================================================================================
#
#   intrinsics - Bindings::Intrinsics: a realm's web namespaces, prototypes and constructors
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of Libraries/LibWeb/Bindings/Intrinsics.cpp (lines 1-58) and Intrinsics.h (lines
#       1-133). The Intrinsics cell of a realm holds the interface prototype objects, interface
#       objects and namespace objects created on first use. Those are JS objects made by the
#       generated bindings (phase 3, DESIGN.md §3.6); in phase 1 the tables stay empty and the
#       cell is data: created for every realm, reached through its HostDefined, visited.
